OL,3,GNEWSAMan completes 39 marathons for
OL,4,Ababy loss charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Shropshire man has completed weekly
OL,7,Fmarathons in all 39 of England's
OL,8,Fhistoric counties to raise money for a
OL,9,Fcharity close to his heart.
OL,11,FOlly Brown, from Shrewsbury, started on
OL,12,F28 December, and finished on 19
OL,13,FSeptember in Norfolk.
OL,15,FHe estimated that he has raised nearly
OL,16,F#90,000 altogether for baby loss
OL,17,Fcharity Tommy's - after he and his wife
OL,18,Fexperienced a traumatic miscarriage in
OL,19,F2022.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
